{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/20269PJDvVCVdV1795661150.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>李亞男迎來42歲生日，她在社交平台分享多張慶生靚相。向來痛錫老婆的「愛妻號」王祖藍不但送上甜蜜冧語「閃盲」網民，更特意上載慶生短片，夫妻二人的互動既爆笑又溫馨。</p><p></p><p>從相中所見，李亞男身穿一襲吊帶波點長裙，收到極具設計感的精美生日蛋糕，並擺出多個得意甫士；白滑肌膚加上甜美笑容，令她看起來少女味十足，完全不似二孩之母。出名是「愛妻號」的王祖藍，隨即甜絲絲留言祝賀：「24歲生日快樂」。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"2c9e4a43-1305-4c4b-8388-8753244ab361.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026eedrDeFKI31795661150.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"a73968ba-c96b-4594-a04d-2a3f4b45870e.jpeg.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026uJuykuiACa1795661149.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>除了冧爆留言外，王祖藍亦特意上載短片為愛妻慶生。片中他與「生日女」大玩包剪揼遊戲，最終連環落敗的祖藍搞到滿頭忌廉，更企圖往太太身上蹭，整個畫面又sweet又搞笑。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"f2239311-3bbf-4cf8-8997-0b7768986be8.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/11/2026ebEIwm5C6f1795661149.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:00:05.410240+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":272,"images":4,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-26T02:45:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-26T14:57:18.598217+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-26T03:53:28.955590+00:00","content_hash":"11c72a74fd5d018b13bbda6bd623b2e6604b856a6f033aec6a3b2b8a5b2e7aa6","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-26T04:00:05.410240+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}